# finn-comp - Desktop render rules (primary target)

## Layers
1. wallpaper (static, z=0)
2. windows (z=10-90, freeform)
3. dock/shell (z=100, always-on-top, input-pass-through except pill bounds)
4. overlay/launcher (z=200)
5. cursor (HW cursor, z=1000)

## Budget (i3-4130 / 4GB / HD4400)
- compositor RAM <120MB, VRAM <60MB @1080p
- wallpaper: 1x 1920x1080 RGBA texture, cached on GPU, never redrawn unless theme/wallpaper changes
- dock: 1x small surface (~320x36), redrawn only on damage (clock 1/min, tray on event)
- no backdrop blur, no shadows, no per-frame gradients. Flute lines baked into wallpaper texture.
- vsync + damage tracking via wl_surface.damage. Idle: 0fps (static). Empty desktop = 0 redraws.
- frame budget 16.6ms, if miss 2x -> drop to 30fps, never tear (DRM atomic).

## Input (Desktop only)
- pointer: HW cursor, hover focus, click-to-raise
- keyboard: Super+Space launcher, Super+Q close, Alt-Tab tasks, Super+arrows snap
- no touch gestures on Desktop target. Fold/dpad paths disabled.

## OTA / finnpkg
- DesktopHome.fbin + wallpaper.avif in read-only .finn, verified on boot.
- dock clock/tray read from system bus, not app processes.
